  unitName: Warlord Pig-Bull (EU)
  unitId: 760155
  unitNumber: 7105
  description: "Pig Bull, now a Warlord at Coal Cauldron\u2019s side, successfully
    completed his mission by sabotaging Bloody Blink\u2019s Techs during the attack
    and allowing the residents of her fortress to be annihilated. Like his allies,
    he uses Techs. Now he rolls over his enemies like never before, without even
    hearing the cries of his (numerous) victims."
  summonDesc: The blood of our enemies will decorate my wheels.
  fusionDesc: "A tip: don\u2019t cross me when I\u2019m behind the wheel."
  evoDesc: I feel that my victim quota is going to increase.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
